I really, really, REALLY do not like key lime pie.

17
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:47,950
Yeah, um, neither do I. Can we change it?

18
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:50,620
No, gosh. And you don't even have to eat it.

19
00:00:50,620 --> 00:00:54,210
Yeah. Like, get a, like, chocolate
cake next time we're here.

20
00:00:54,210 --> 00:00:56,660
Ooh, I love chocolate!

21
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,125
Hey, me too!

22
00:00:58,125 --> 00:01:00,525
I also love ice cream cake!

23
00:01:00,610 --> 00:01:03,580
Oh, my bubble blower, that's so delish!

24
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:05,970
Shush, sheesh! Let's get on with it.

25
00:01:05,970 --> 00:01:08,982
So, if you get no cake, you leave BFDI.

26
00:01:09,257 --> 00:01:12,370
Pin, you have a Win Token.
Would you like to use it now?

27
00:01:12,370 --> 00:01:13,611
Uh, no.

28
00:01:13,965 --> 00:01:16,490
I mean, there's nothing mean
I did that I can think of

29
00:01:16,490 --> 00:01:18,110
that would make people want to vote me.

30
00:01:18,110 --> 00:01:20,205
It's this stupid Blocky here. It's his fault!

31
00:01:20,514 --> 00:01:21,771
I get to push you off!

32
00:01:21,771 --> 00:01:23,770
I don't know! They're all pretty bad.

33
00:01:23,770 --> 00:01:24,780
BLEGH!

34
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:27,577
There's too much weight on this sinking boat!

35
00:01:27,577 --> 00:01:29,570
We have to throw someone overboard!

36
00:01:29,570 --> 00:01:30,960
Uh-oh!

37
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:33,320
Alliance, shmalliance. go, GO!

38
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:34,457
WOODY:
AAAUUUH!

39
00:01:34,731 --> 00:01:37,051
Okay, then. No Win Token for you.

40
00:01:37,542 --> 00:01:39,988
