41
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:41,211
Eraser.

42
00:01:42,640 --> 00:01:43,394
EUGH!

43
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:44,411
What?

44
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:47,074
All cake is good cake!

45
00:01:47,165 --> 00:01:48,754
Also at zero votes...

46
00:01:49,908 --> 00:01:50,770
