54
00:02:03,450 --> 00:02:04,137
Whoa!

55
00:02:06,594 --> 00:02:08,285
ANNOUNCER:
Match, no need to worry.

56
00:02:08,594 --> 00:02:10,280
You, too, are at one vote.

57
00:02:10,514 --> 00:02:12,434
