58
00:02:12,948 --> 00:02:14,010
Blocky...

59
00:02:14,010 --> 00:02:15,390
Spongy...

60
00:02:15,390 --> 00:02:16,297
and Woody.

61
00:02:16,605 --> 00:02:18,651
Now I will call out who else is safe.

62
00:02:19,108 --> 00:02:20,120
At two votes is-

63
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:22,011
It's got to be Blocky.

64
00:02:22,011 --> 00:02:24,010
Uh, sure. Yeah, Blocky.

65
00:02:24,422 --> 00:02:25,017
Spongy-

66
00:02:25,017 --> 00:02:27,010
HEAUUUAUUOOUEAHHHOO!

67
00:02:27,165 --> 00:02:29,010
