68
00:02:29,010 --> 00:02:29,771
Ahh...

69
00:02:30,091 --> 00:02:32,788
So we have to send him to the TLC.

70
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:36,822
Our sender scoop thrower has not
been tested, but I'll use it.

71
00:02:44,480 --> 00:02:51,257
♪ [INTRO PLAYS] ♪

72
00:02:51,257 --> 00:02:53,257
Subtitles: Daniel Adam Valle

73
