75
00:02:59,097 --> 00:03:01,691
The team that gets the higher total score wins.

76
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:05,062
The highest-scoring contestant receives a Win Token.

77
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:08,930
Oh, and Grapes, an Ice Cube
Recovery Center Creator

78
00:03:08,930 --> 00:03:11,885
