- MATCH: Spongy! Spongy!

123
00:05:18,610 --> 00:05:20,360
- PENCIL: Match? Uh...
- MATCH: Five, six, seven, eight.

124
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:22,240
- PENCIL: Match? I-I don't think that's...
